# Leaflyte — environment variables
#
# AI API keys are NOT configured here.
# They are stored in browser localStorage only (Settings → AI) and never committed to git.
#
# Copy to .env.local and keep .env.local out of git (already in .gitignore).

# Example (unused today):
# VAULT_DIR=./vault

# Tauri release builds — signing key file (gitignored): src-tauri/.tauri-signing.key
# npm run tauri:build reads that file automatically.
# Optional if your key has a password:
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD=
